# Operator UI screenshots

When you change `src/benedict/operator_ui/` (the HTML page, recorded stages, or the HTTP API the page reads):

1. Verify in the browser at a **desktop width** (~1280px). A phone-width clip of the activity list is not enough.
2. Commit PNG screenshots under `docs/assets/` of the changed view. For inspector work, include **Why this answer** with the new panel visible; if the change is chunk text, show an expanded chunk.
3. Embed those images in the pull request **Screenshots** section. Do not omit or delete that section for operator UI work.

The PR template and CONTRIBUTING.md require the same for landing page, docs chrome, and Slack Block Kit.
